{"seq":3,"slug":"ideas-and-methods","title":"孙子·ideas-and-methods","stage":"DONE","category":"sun-tzu","categoryLabel":"孙子","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3,"positioning":4,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/13_sun-tzu/3_ideas-and-methods","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"思想与方法\">思想与方法</h1><p>本卷拆解孙子军事思想的<strong>方法内核</strong>——不是讲孙子是谁、做过什么（那属于 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>），也不是评价其历史地位（那属于 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>），而是回答一个问题：孙子用兵的&quot;操作系统&quot;由哪些可复用的方法构成，它们如何彼此咬合。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本卷-vs-兄弟卷的分工\">本卷 vs 兄弟卷的分工</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>卷</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本卷的关系</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a></td>\n<td>孙子在军事思想史上贡献了什么</td>\n<td>本卷是其贡献的<strong>方法细节</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>本卷·思想与方法</td>\n<td>孙子的方法如何运作、如何衔接</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">代表著作</a></td>\n<td>《孙子兵法》文本本身</td>\n<td>本卷是文本的<strong>思想提炼</strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>这些方法被谁、如何继承应用</td>\n<td>本卷是其影响的<strong>思想源头</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>避免重复：同一史实（如银雀山汉简、成书年代）只在首次出现处展开；跨卷以相对链接互引而不复述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三章一条主线-目标-认知-用兵\">三章一条主线：目标 → 认知 → 用兵</h2><p>三章不是并列罗列，而是一条从战略到战术的逻辑链：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[第一章 全胜与伐谋&lt;br/&gt;定目标与手段次序] --&gt; B[第二章 知彼与庙算&lt;br/&gt;定决策的认知基础]&#10;    B --&gt; C[第三章 形与势&lt;br/&gt;定临阵用兵之法]\">flowchart LR\n    A[第一章 全胜与伐谋&lt;br/&gt;定目标与手段次序] --&gt; B[第二章 知彼与庙算&lt;br/&gt;定决策的认知基础]\n    B --&gt; C[第三章 形与势&lt;br/&gt;定临阵用兵之法]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong><a href=\"supreme-strategy/\">第一章 全胜与伐谋</a></strong>——顶层战略。<a href=\"supreme-strategy/subduing-without-battle\">全胜思想</a> 立&quot;不战而屈人之兵&quot;为目标；<a href=\"supreme-strategy/attacking-strategy\">上兵伐谋</a> 立&quot;伐谋&gt;伐交&gt;伐兵&gt;攻城&quot;为手段次序。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"knowing-and-calculating/\">第二章 知彼与庙算</a></strong>——决策方法。<a href=\"knowing-and-calculating/know-yourself-know-enemy\">知彼知己的方法论</a> 定&quot;认知决定胜负预期&quot;的原则；<a href=\"knowing-and-calculating/the-five-factors\">五事七计</a> 把认知拆成可比维度（道天地将法 + 七组对比）。</li>\n<li><strong><a href=\"form-and-momentum/\">第三章 形与势</a></strong>——临阵之法。<a href=\"form-and-momentum/substance-and-void\">虚实之道</a> 定&quot;打哪里&quot;（避实击虚、我专敌分）；<a href=\"form-and-momentum/orthodox-and-unorthodox\">奇正之变与形势</a> 定&quot;怎么打、靠什么势头打&quot;（以正合以奇胜、造势任势）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径与前置\">推荐学习路径与前置</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Pre[前置:了解《孙子兵法》十三篇结构&lt;br/&gt;见 代表著作] --&gt; S1[1·全胜思想]&#10;    S1 --&gt; S2[1·上兵伐谋]&#10;    S2 --&gt; S3[2·知彼知己]&#10;    S3 --&gt; S4[2·五事七计]&#10;    S4 --&gt; S5[3·虚实之道]&#10;    S5 --&gt; S6[3·奇正之变与形势]\">flowchart TD\n    Pre[前置:了解《孙子兵法》十三篇结构&lt;br/&gt;见 代表著作] --&gt; S1[1·全胜思想]\n    S1 --&gt; S2[1·上兵伐谋]\n    S2 --&gt; S3[2·知彼知己]\n    S3 --&gt; S4[2·五事七计]\n    S4 --&gt; S5[3·虚实之道]\n    S5 --&gt; S6[3·奇正之变与形势]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：先浏览 <a href=\"../major-works/the-art-of-war/\">代表著作·孙子兵法</a> 了解十三篇结构，再读本卷理解最佳；本卷诸法在原书中的篇目，已在各篇内标注。</li>\n<li><strong>建议顺序</strong>：按上图自上而下。目标层（第一章）给你&quot;为何而战&quot;的标尺，认知层（第二章）给你&quot;该不该战&quot;的判据，用兵层（第三章）给你&quot;如何战&quot;的手法——逆序阅读会失去这条因果链。</li>\n<li><strong>进阶</strong>：读完本卷后，到 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/global-influence/\">影响与遗产·全球影响</a> 看这些方法如何被现代商业、管理迁移使用；到 <a href=\"../core-contributions/strategic-philosophy/\">核心贡献·战略哲学</a> 看这些方法的哲学统合。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"一句话记住每篇\">一句话记住每篇</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>篇</th>\n<th>一句话</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全胜思想</td>\n<td>完整拿下优于打烂——损耗账决定优先级</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>上兵伐谋</td>\n<td>越作用于敌之决策层，杠杆越大、代价越低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>知彼知己</td>\n<td>认知状态决定胜负预期，知己常比知彼更难</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>五事七计</td>\n<td>用五维度、七组对比把胜负&quot;算&quot;出来</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>虚实之道</td>\n<td>我专敌分，在接触点造出局部 10:1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>奇正与形势</td>\n<td>以正合以奇胜，求之于势、不责于人</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"supreme-strategy","title":"全胜与伐谋","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/supreme-strategy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"subduing-without-battle","title":"全胜思想：不战而屈人之兵","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/supreme-strategy/subduing-without-battle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"attacking-strategy","title":"上兵伐谋：手段的优先次序","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/supreme-strategy/attacking-strategy"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"knowing-and-calculating","title":"知彼与庙算","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-calculating","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"know-yourself-know-enemy","title":"知彼知己的方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-calculating/know-yourself-know-enemy"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-five-factors","title":"五事七计：庙算的量化框架","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/knowing-and-calculating/the-five-factors"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"form-and-momentum","title":"形与势","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"substance-and-void","title":"虚实之道：避实击虚与致人而不致于人","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum/substance-and-void"},{"seq":2,"slug":"orthodox-and-unorthodox","title":"奇正之变与形势","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/sun-tzu/ideas-and-methods/form-and-momentum/orthodox-and-unorthodox"}]}]}